{"id":"a57c7b6c9fd3f545","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-preserves-stationary.md","title":"ZFC Preserves Stationary","display":"df-zfc-preserves-stationary — ZFC Preserves Stationary","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-preserves-stationary","aliases":["58-df-zfc-preserves-stationary"],"display":"df-zfc-preserves-stationary — ZFC Preserves Stationary","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ctm]]","[[58-df-poset]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-free-variable]]","[[58-df-assignment]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing-relation]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-canonical-check-name.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-preserves-stationary"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-preserves-stationary</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-preserves-stationary — ZFC Preserves Stationary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"58-df-ctm\">58-df-ctm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable\">58-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"58-df-assignment\">58-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-relation\">58-df-zfc-forcing-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"fb43b1e2c83c0e1a\" href=\"?note=fb43b1e2c83c0e1a\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-canonical-check-name.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-canonical-check-name.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb P,R,1_{\\mathbb P},A,\\kappa,\\widehat A,\\widehat\\kappa,\\vec\\tau\\in V\">\\(M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb P,R,1_{\\mathbb P},A,\\kappa,\\widehat A,\\widehat\\kappa,\\vec\\tau\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTMInLanguage}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{CTMInLanguage}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\">\\(I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\\)</span> is the membership-relation interpretation projection</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{\\mathrm{stat}}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\varphi_{\\mathrm{stat}}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span> is the fixed formula code expressing that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> is stationary in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1\">\\(v_1\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi_{\\mathrm{stat}})\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi_{\\mathrm{stat}})\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PreservesStationary}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{PreservesStationary}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span> 取公理文件的固定成员语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> 使用该语言的公式编码，对所引集合谓词先作避捕获的定义展开。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{\\mathrm{stat}}\">\\(\\varphi_{\\mathrm{stat}}\\)</span> 由正文唯一固定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{\\mathrm{stat}}\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Stationary}(v_0,v_1)\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_{\\mathrm{stat}}\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Stationary}(v_0,v_1)\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}preserves\\text{-}stationary}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PreservesStationary}_S(M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb P,R,1_{\\mathbb P},A,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CTMInLanguage}_S(M,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\Gamma)\n\\land\\mathbb P,R,A,\\kappa\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,R,1_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\varphi_{\\mathrm{stat}}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi_{\\mathrm{stat}})\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists\\mathcal M,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s,\n\\widehat A,\\widehat\\kappa,\\vec\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=M\n\\land I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\n=\\{a\\in M^2:a(0)\\in a(1)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\n\\land s(v_0)=A\\land s(v_1)=\\kappa\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi_{\\mathrm{stat}},s)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\widehat A,\\widehat\\kappa\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S\n(\\widehat A,A,\\mathbb P,R,1_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S\n(\\widehat\\kappa,\\kappa,\\mathbb P,R,1_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,2,M)\n\\land\\vec\\tau(0)=\\widehat A\\land\\vec\\tau(1)=\\widehat\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(M,1_{\\mathbb P},\\varphi_{\\mathrm{stat}},\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,R)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}preserves\\text{-}stationary}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PreservesStationary}_S(M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb P,R,1_{\\mathbb P},A,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CTMInLanguage}_S(M,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\Gamma)\n\\land\\mathbb P,R,A,\\kappa\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,R,1_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\varphi_{\\mathrm{stat}}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi_{\\mathrm{stat}})\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists\\mathcal M,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s,\n\\widehat A,\\widehat\\kappa,\\vec\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=M\n\\land I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\n=\\{a\\in M^2:a(0)\\in a(1)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\n\\land s(v_0)=A\\land s(v_1)=\\kappa\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi_{\\mathrm{stat}},s)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\widehat A,\\widehat\\kappa\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S\n(\\widehat A,A,\\mathbb P,R,1_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S\n(\\widehat\\kappa,\\kappa,\\mathbb P,R,1_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,2,M)\n\\land\\vec\\tau(0)=\\widehat A\\land\\vec\\tau(1)=\\widehat\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(M,1_{\\mathbb P},\\varphi_{\\mathrm{stat}},\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,R)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ground model is a set-coded CTM in the membership language.  Its initial stationarity claim is checked by a selected satisfaction recursion, not by the external stationarity predicate, which need not be absolute to a CTM.</li>\n<li>Both canonical names and the two-entry name tuple are explicit set witnesses.  The same formula code is evaluated in the ground model and passed to the six-place forcing relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ctm","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ctm]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","